# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Husky generates its internal hook shim directory at install time; never
# commit it (the tracked hook files live in `.husky/<hook-name>` directly).
.husky/_/

# Defense-in-depth against accidentally committing a Tauri updater signing
# key. The real key lives at ~/.tauri/ outside the repo, but this catches
# anyone who runs `tauri signer generate -w ./<something>.key` from here.
*.key
*.key.pub

# Created by the release workflow as scratch input for `gh release create`;
# also created locally if you run `git-cliff` by hand.
.release-notes.md

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
